    <string name="about_dialog_body">AXIS Neo is the mobile companion to the AXIS accessibility auditing platform. It performs WCAG 2.2 checks including contrast ratio, alt text, ARIA roles, keyboard focus, landmark structure, and more.\n\nResults are powered by \u003cb\u003eAXIS Core SDK\u003c/b\u003e — a cross-runtime accessibility engine published on npm, NuGet, and crates.io.</string>
